{"name":"Enchant","hex":"#d1c6d2","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"enchant","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To attract and delight, to charm.","To cast a spell upon (often one that attracts or charms)."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["An enchantment"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/enchant"}],"entries":[{"title":"Incantation","blocks":[{"text":"An incantation, spell, charm, enchantment, or bewitchery is a magical formula intended to trigger a magical effect on a person or objects. The formula can be spoken, sung, or chanted. An incantation can also be performed during ceremonial rituals or prayers. In the world of magic, wizards, witches, and fairies are common performers of incantations in culture and folklore."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/46/Book_of_incantations_f.7v.png/330px-Book_of_incantations_f.7v.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Incantation"},{"title":"Enchant (band)","blocks":[{"text":"Enchant is an American neo-prog band, formed in 1989. Their music is characterized by ambitious lyrics and melodies along with harmonic and rhythmic experimentation."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6a/Enchant_-_ROSFest_-_May_3%2C_2015.jpg/330px-Enchant_-_ROSFest_-_May_3%2C_2015.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Enchant_(band)"},{"title":"Enchant (software)","blocks":[{"text":"Enchant is a free software project developed as part of the AbiWord word processor with the aim of unifying access to the various existing spell-checker software. Enchant wraps a common set of functionality present in a variety of existing products/libraries, and exposes a stable API/ABI for doing so. Where a library doesn't implement some specific functionality, Enchant will emulate it."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Enchant_(software)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2b/The_Enchanted_Garden_of_Messer_Ansaldo_by_Marie_Spartali_Stillman_%281889%29.jpg/500px-The_Enchanted_Garden_of_Messer_Ansaldo_by_Marie_Spartali_Stillman_%281889%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2b/The_Enchanted_Garden_of_Messer_Ansaldo_by_Marie_Spartali_Stillman_%281889%29.jpg/500px-The_Enchanted_Garden_of_Messer_Ansaldo_by_Marie_Spartali_Stillman_%281889%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The Enchanted Garden of Messer Ansaldo by Marie Spartali Stillman","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AThe_Enchanted_Garden_of_Messer_Ansaldo_by_Marie_Spartali_Stillman_(1889).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0d/Abracadabra_triangle_%28cropped%29.jpg/250px-Abracadabra_triangle_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0d/Abracadabra_triangle_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0d/Abracadabra_triangle_%28cropped%29.jpg/250px-Abracadabra_triangle_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Classic magic words","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AAbracadabra_triangle_(cropped).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/42/Orlando_Furioso_13.jpg/500px-Orlando_Furioso_13.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/42/Orlando_Furioso_13.jpg/500px-Orlando_Furioso_13.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The enchantress Alcina makes herself appe